Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:04.50,English,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the world of Ar nosurge.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.80,0:00:09.40,English,,0,0,0,,The world you are about to enter\Nexists seven dimensions away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:13.90,English,,0,0,0,,You are now authorized to intervene in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.95,0:00:18.70,English,,0,0,0,,First, you will be briefed on the situation\Nin the timeline to which you will connect.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.50,0:00:22.25,English,,0,0,0,,Seventh-dimensional stabilizer online.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.75,0:00:24.25,English,,0,0,0,,Linking to the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.25,0:00:37.75,English,,0,0,0,,A powerful Empress once reigned over this world.\NThe people were deeply devoted to their Empress,\Nand the power of her Songs was immense.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.00,0:00:51.50,English,,0,0,0,,At that time, the world this Empress ruled was on the verge of destruction.\NDue to the expansion of their sun, Bezel,\Nthe planet Ra Ciela was fated to be consumed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.12,0:01:00.00,English,,0,0,0,,To save the people, the Empress swore to transport them all to safety,\Nsacrificing their dying planet in the process.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.38,0:01:09.62,English,,0,0,0,,However, during the ritual, an unforeseen event occurred.\NThe people lost both their planet and the resultant energy,\Nand could not travel to their new utopia.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.25,0:01:21.38,English,,0,0,0,,The people also lost the power of Song, along with their planet.\NThis was because Genom, responsible for creating miracles out of song,\Nwere destroyed along with the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.25,0:01:31.25,English,,0,0,0,,The people, having lost their home world and the magic of Song,\Nwere forced to drift aimlessly through space on a ship,\Ntheir thoughts full of despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.62,0:01:44.25,English,,0,0,0,,Then, after thousands of years of travel, another disaster befell the human ship.\NMysterious life forms known as “Sharl” appeared suddenly,\Nand began attacking the humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.62,0:01:59.12,English,,0,0,0,,After that day, humanity was split into two conflicting factions.\NOne, a religious organization called the Genomirai Church,\Nworshipped the Sharl, choosing to coexist to escape hardship.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.88,0:02:07.12,English,,0,0,0,,The other was determined to fight off the Sharl,\Nand worked to restore the peace of the past.\NA city-state known as Felion.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.88,0:02:18.25,English,,0,0,0,,Even now, the people continue to fight, hoping to find true peace.\NStill searching for their utopia, somewhere in this universe...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.05,0:02:21.95,English,,0,0,0,,World status database. End of file.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.00,0:02:24.80,English,,0,0,0,,Interdimensional connection online.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.00,0:02:27.40,English,,0,0,0,,Startup sequence complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.05,0:02:29.95,English,,0,0,0,,All permissions granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.70,0:02:34.10,English,,0,0,0,,May good fortune be with you.
